Package: refugia
Title: Identify Climate Refugia from Mergeable Sums on S2 Cells
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A framework for identifying climate refugia within Australia
    and Antarctica. Metrics (trend, signal-to-noise, velocity, persistence)
    are computed from per-cell sufficient statistics on S2 cells, so any
    union of cells or periods aggregates exactly.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: s2, terra
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
